      "quote": "{",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "**硬断言**：Parcel 若被标记为 RPC 用途，就不能走本地 binder——这是防止两条通道混用的防线。"
    },
    {
      "at": 5,
      "quote": "LOG_ALWAYS_FATAL_IF(data.isForRpc(), \"Parcel constructed for RPC, but being used with binder.\");",
